13
00:01:16,094 --> 00:01:18,900
And that's why Abu Bakr As-Siddique(أبوبكرالصديق) as we mentioned in a statement, he said;

14
00:01:19,347 --> 00:01:22,710
لقد انقطع الوحي وتم الدين، أينقص وأنا حي؟

15
00:01:23,698 --> 00:01:28,582
The revelation has stopped, meaning Jibreel(جِبْرِيْل) will not come and fix our mistakes, now.

