00:01:28,675 --> 00:01:31,839
Jibreel(جِبْرِيْل) is not going to descend after the death of Rasool Allah ﷺ.

17
00:01:32,819 --> 00:01:33,545
"وتم الدين"

18
00:01:33,585 --> 00:01:35,196
And the religion is complete.

19
00:01:35,912 --> 00:01:39,174
So I'm not going to allow to diminish, while I'm alive

20
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:44,052
I am not going to allow the religion of Islam to go down when I'm still alive.

21
