Do not by any means let self admiration enter you because

772
00:55:01,614 --> 00:55:03,941
Khalid Ibn Walid(خالد ابن وليد) is at such a high status.

773
00:55:04,538 --> 00:55:06,694
Al-Khalifah(خليفه) wants to make sure that his heart is clean.

