00:55:07,155 --> 00:55:08,930
That Shaytan(شَيْطَانْ) does not get into his heart.

775
00:55:10,203 --> 00:55:15,836
Do not by any means let self admiration enter you, so that you lose and fall.

776
00:55:16,710 --> 00:55:20,827
See that you do not rely upon any works of yours,

777
00:55:20,995 --> 00:55:26,715
