778
00:55:27,329 --> 00:55:32,186
Don't let Ujb(عجب) enter your heart and don't depend on your deeds depends on Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ.

779
00:55:33,982 --> 00:55:36,091
So, the letter reaches to Khalid Ibn Walid(خالد ابن وليد)

780
00:55:36,583 --> 00:55:41,517
