00:56:17,304 --> 00:56:20,768
So Subhaan Allah(سُبْحَان الله) I mean, they have the same number of forces.

791
00:56:22,006 --> 00:56:25,871
But even though it was past the time of Rasool Allah ﷺ,

792
00:56:25,911 --> 00:56:30,478
they would still fighting of what Rasool Allah ﷺ, left them with.

