00:56:31,604 --> 00:56:34,238
He was the one, who gave them the ammunition for all of this.

794
00:56:34,916 --> 00:56:37,250
So the Fatuhaat(فتوحات) that happened the time of Abu Bakr(ابوبكر),

795
00:56:37,275 --> 00:56:39,020
and that happened in a time of Umar(عُمَر),

796
00:56:39,391 --> 00:56:43,281
were just a product of the Tarbiyat(تربيعة) of Rasool Allah ﷺ,

797
00:56:44,297 --> 00:56:46,914
one Sahabi(صحابي) counts like an entire army.

798
00:56:48,073 --> 00:56:50,359
Rasool Allah ﷺ trained them in Madina.

799
00:56:51,748 --> 00:56:54,664
And the Persian Empire and Roman Empire, they didn't care about Madina,

800
00:56:54,689 --> 00:56:56,812
many of them didn't even know what Madina was?

801
00:56:57,398 --> 00:57:00,941
But they didn't know that the seeds of their destruction were planted in Madina,

802
00:57:01,227 --> 00:57:04,178
that Rasool Allah ﷺ even though he was miles and miles away from them,

803
00:57:04,539 --> 00:57:08,382
he was raising up in the poor quarters of Madina,

804
00:57:08,710 --> 00:57:11,519
the ones, who will spread light to the corners of the world.

805
00:57:13,267 --> 00:57:15,587
So Al-Muthanna(ألمثنى) is saying I'm not going to allow you to take these.

806
00:57:15,612 --> 00:57:18,142
So, Khalid Ibn Walid(خالد ابن وليد) is giving him one companion after another.

807
00:57:18,247 --> 00:57:19,101
"حتى ألرضى"

808
00:57:19,129 --> 00:57:20,362
Until he pleased him.

