00:58:11,439 --> 00:58:17,534
I have fought against the Arabs and Al-Ajam(ألعجم), in Jahiliyyah(جَاهلِيَّة) and Islam.

822
00:58:17,555 --> 00:58:19,931
 Al-Ajam(ألعجم) are the non Arabs.

823
00:58:20,092 --> 00:58:23,299
He said: I fight with them in Islam and before Islam,

824
00:58:23,655 --> 00:58:33,507
he says: It used to be that 100 of Al-Ajam(ألعجم) were stronger than 1000 of the Arabs.

825
00:58:34,211 --> 00:58:40,599
But now 100 of the Arabs are stronger than 1000 of Al-Ajam(ألعجم) because of Islam.

826
00:58:41,534 --> 00:58:47,741
