00:59:42,837 --> 00:59:50,771
and had more equipment and they're well built while their opponents were slim and thin.

839
00:59:51,723 --> 00:59:54,786
I mean, we say that Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) was tall and Khalid Ibn Walid(خالد ابن وليد) was tall,

