00:59:54,913 --> 00:59:58,219
 but in general these were people, who came out of the desert.

841
00:59:59,342 --> 01:00:05,960
So in terms of the stature, definitely the armies of the Romans were stronger built than them.

842
01:00:06,474 --> 01:00:07,821
But then Ibn Al-Qayyim(إبن ألقيم) says,

843
01:00:08,154 --> 01:00:11,065
ولكن قلوبهم خانتهم حين كان أهج ألناس عليها

844
01:00:11,687 --> 01:00:14,368
But their hearts failed them, when they needed them most.

845
01:00:14,726 --> 01:00:18,172
So, these big bodies don't have a strong heart

