01:00:31,538 --> 01:00:35,739
I mean, there's something called Al-Wahn(ألوهن), weakness.

850
01:00:36,265 --> 01:00:40,243
Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ can put Wahn(ألوهن) in the heart of somebody,

851
01:00:41,115 --> 01:00:45,348
whose fingers are on buttons of the most powerful weapon on the face of the earth,

852
01:00:45,755 --> 01:00:47,127
but he will not be able to function it.

853
01:00:47,913 --> 01:00:50,424
Because Allah has put Wahn(ألوهن) in his heart.

854
01:00:51,031 --> 01:00:53,890
Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ talks about the Battle of Rasool Allah ﷺ with Al-Yahood(أليهود),

855
01:00:54,641 --> 01:00:56,159
وَقَذَفَ فِى قُلُوبِهِمُ ٱلرُّعْبَ

856
01:00:56,508 --> 01:01:01,298
Allah cast fear in their hearts, they had the strongest forts,

857
01:01:02,039 --> 01:01:05,368
but Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ when he put fear in their hearts, their force did not help,

858
01:01:05,500 --> 01:01:07,956
their weapons did not help and their numbers did not help.

859
01:01:09,492 --> 01:01:13,310
And Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ is the One, Who controls the hearts and He can put Wahn(ألوهن)

