I hope to die on this day of mine.

888
01:03:26,034 --> 01:03:33,333
If I die, do not by any means let the evening enter before you have summon the men to go with Al-Muthanna(ألمثنى)

889
01:03:34,092 --> 01:03:37,448
if I delay, until the night do not by any means,

890
01:03:37,831 --> 01:03:41,458
